# A bitten jelly bun at the bakery (The Missing Cat). Format: dialogue/dialogue_parser.gd
@when cat_clue_3 -> again

== offer ==
A jelly bun with a neat little bite out of it, and a few orange hairs stuck in the jam. [set cat_clue_3]
Marta's going to be [shake]furious[/shake]. The thief is probably full and sleepy by now. Somewhere sunny, and high up...

== again ==
Half a jelly bun. The thief clearly had a great time.
